### Criar produto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Torresmo",
  "code":"tor001",
  "description": "Torresmo frito",
  "categoryId":1,
  "supplierId":2,
  "size":"XL",
  "color":"BLUE",
  "purchasePrice":12.45,
  "salesPrice":18.23,
  "minimalStock":3,
  "stock":10,
  "isActive": true
}

### Atualizar produto
PUT  http://localhost:8080/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saia Jeans Levi's",
  "code":"saia003",
  "description": "Saia Jeans Levi's desbotada",
  "categoryId":1,
  "supplierId":2,
  "size":"M",
  "color":"Gray",
  "purchasePrice":32.45,
  "salesPrice":48.23,
  "minimalStock":12,
  "stock":45,
  "isActive": true
}

### Buscar produtos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

### Buscar produto por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/2
Content-Type: application/json

### Remover produto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/product/3
